The vulnerability is in `H5D__chunk_lock` at line 3967:
```c
if(udata->new_unfilt_chunk) {
    void *tmp_chunk = chunk;
    if(NULL == (chunk = H5D__chunk_mem_alloc(my_chunk_alloc, pline))) {
        ...
    }
    H5MM_memcpy(chunk, tmp_chunk, chunk_size);
    ...
